   "strokeColor": "#0078D4",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_4",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 212,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 30.400000000000002,
   "text": "REGISTRY",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_5",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 248,
   "width": 390,
   "height": 179.20000000000002,
   "text": "Map<id -> Tool>\n\n• register(tool)\n• list()  (palette reads this)\n• resolve(id)\n\nAdd a tool = add a function.\nNo separate tool catalog.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "yaml_c",
   "x": 990,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 670,
   "height": 300,
   "strokeColor": "#F7630C",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_6",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 212,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 28.8,
   "text": "PIPELINE FILE = YAML  (REPRESENTATION)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_7",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 246,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 228.8,
   "text": "version: 1\nsteps:\n  - id: prompt\n    tool: prompt.liquid\n    with: { template: \"{{subject}} pixel art\",\n            vars: { subject: knight } }\n    ui: { x: 340, y: 260 }          # runner ignores\n  - id: generate\n    tool: image.generate\n    with: { model: gpt-image-2, size: 1024x1024 }\n    needs: [{ port: prompt, from: prompt.text }]",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "rep_c",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 530,
   "width": 920,
   "height": 150,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#F3F2F1",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_8",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 880,
   "height": 27.200000000000003,
   "text": "REPRESENTATION  ≠  STEPS   (the core split)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_9",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 576,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 83.2,
   "text": "REPRESENTATION = canvas nodes + YAML + ui:{x,y} + previews.  Exists for VIEWER EASE. Never executes.\nSTEPS = the tool.run() actions that actually happen (calls, slicing, downloads).  The runner only runs STEPS.\nA SINK (preview/download) is a STEP with outputs:[] -- it consumes a value and surfaces it to the REPRESENTATION\nlayer (inspector/file). 'sink' is terminal-only: NOT a connectable value type, nothing wires out of it.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "img_c",
   "x": 990,
   "y": 530,
   "width": 670,
   "height": 150,
   "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_10",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 542,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 25.6,
   "text": "ImageValue  (portable value on 'image' ports)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_11",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 574,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 83.2,
   "text": "type ImageValue = { bytes: Uint8Array, mimeType: string,\n                    width?: number, height?: number }\nWorker returns bytes. slice / preview / download all speak\nImageValue -> identical in browser + node.  NOT a URL/DOM node.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "pt_c",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 710,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 180,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#F3F2F1",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_12",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 722,
   "width": 410,
   "height": 24,
   "text": "PORT TYPES",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_13",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 752,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 145.6,
   "text": "text | image | image[] | int | json\n(sink = terminal, not wireable)\n\nEdge valid iff out.type == in.type.\nimage[] → image is a MISMATCH.\nLiterals: int strict (no coerce, >0 where\nrequired); json = object; options restrict.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "val_c",
   "x": 510,
   "y": 710,
   "width": 450,
   "height": 180,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_14",
   "x": 530,
   "y": 722,
   "width": 410,
   "height": 24,
   "text": "validateGraph(graph, registry)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_15",
   "x": 530,
   "y": 752,
   "width": 430,
   "height": 153.60000000000002,
   "text": "one check, canvas + loaded YAML:\ncycles · dup ids · unknown tool/port ·\nmissing required input · dangling 'from' ·\ninput set by BOTH with+needs · >1 binding\nper input · bad literal type.\nEDIT-TIME: edge type/cardinality only\n(draft nodes w/ missing inputs allowed).\nRUN-TIME: full readiness on the exec set.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "ret_c",
   "x": 990,
   "y": 710,
   "width": 670,
   "height": 300,
   "strokeColor": "#107C10",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_16",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 722,
   "width": 620,
   "height": 25.6,
   "text": "RETAINED OUTPUTS + FREEZE   (iterate without re-paying)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_17",
   "x": 1010,
   "y": 756,
   "width": 650,
   "height": 249.60000000000002,
   "text": "No execution cache. BUT each node keeps its LAST run\noutputs in memory (a retained artifact, not a cache).\n\n• powers inspector preview + \"Download this result\"\n  (no re-run of paid ancestors)\n• FREEZE/PIN an output -> downstream reads the frozen\n  ImageValue.  Mechanically: swap the upstream edge for\n  a const.image holding the retained value.\n  -> change slice rows/cols and RE-SLICE the SAME sheet\n     instantly, zero paid calls.\n• editing a node marks its (+downstream) results STALE.\nRetaining an artifact ≠ caching/idempotency.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "run_c",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 915,
   "width": 920,
   "height": 330,
   "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_18",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 927,
   "width": 800,
   "height": 30.400000000000002,
   "text": "RUNNER  (pure orchestrator; canvas + CLI-later)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_19",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 962,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 208,
   "text": "runGraph(graph, registry, { to?, signal, onNode }) -> { nodes: { id: { status, outputs, error } } }\n\nEXECUTION SET:  {to} -> target + its ancestor closure (each shared ancestor once).  no {to} -> all sinks + ancestors.\nORDER: topo-sort, sequential.   'Run to here' re-runs the closure every time (unless an ancestor is FROZEN).\nFAILURE: a failed node -> its descendants = 'blocked'; independent branches continue.  Draft/disconnected\nnodes NOT in the exec set don't block a valid branch.   default timeout + normalized errors in the runner.\n\nonNode event: { id, status: pending|running|succeeded|failed|blocked|cancelled, outputs?, error? }\nerror = { kind: auth|timeout|network|tool|validation, message, httpStatus? }.  (auth kind covers worker token expiry.)\ncanvas maps results onto nodes by id + output name (multi-output -> inspector output selector).",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "cat_c",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1275,
   "width": 780,
   "height": 290,
   "strokeColor": "#F7630C",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_20",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1287,
   "width": 740,
   "height": 27.200000000000003,
   "text": "PROMPT PRESET CATALOG  (schema-complete snapshot)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_21",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1322,
   "width": 760,
   "height": 228.8,
   "text": "PromptPreset {\n  id, name, tags: string[], sampleImage?: url\n  template: string                       // liquid\n  vars: [{ name, type, required, default }]   // FULL schema\n}\nSelect -> snapshot BOTH template AND the vars schema into the node\n(not just values).  vars schema persists in YAML (with.varsSchema).\nInspector renders typed editable fields from it; validate unresolved\nREQUIRED vars (after needs-resolution) before run.\nIf a var input is wired, it overrides the literal.  Editing template\nre-derives var names; orphaned values dropped.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "con_c",
   "x": 840,
   "y": 1275,
   "width": 820,
   "height": 290,
   "strokeColor": "#107C10",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_22",
   "x": 860,
   "y": 1287,
   "width": 780,
   "height": 27.200000000000003,
   "text": "TOOL CONTRACTS  (initial set)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_23",
   "x": 860,
   "y": 1320,
   "width": 800,
   "height": 230.40000000000003,
   "text": "prompt.liquid           template:text*, vars:json          -> text\nconst.text              value:text*                        -> text\nconst.image             value:image*                       -> image   (freeze target)\nimage.generate          prompt:text*, model=gpt-image-2,    -> image\n                        size=1024x1024, style=None\nimage.removeBackground  image*                             -> image\nsprite.slice            sheet:image*, rows:int=4, cols:int=4 -> frames:image[]\nframes.preview          frames:image[]*                    -> (sink)\nframes.downloadZip      frames:image[]*, filename=sprites.zip -> (sink)\nimage.preview           image*                             -> (sink)\nimage.download          image*, filename=out.png           -> (sink)\n*=required · =default · sinks have outputs:[]",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
  },
  {
   "type": "rectangle",
   "id": "dec_c",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 1590,
   "width": 1620,
   "height": 66,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "#F3F2F1",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1.5,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "t_24",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 1602,
   "width": 1600,
   "height": 20.8,
   "text": "DEFERRED: versioning/immutability · caching/idempotency · adapters · secrets/auth per tool · durable backend · full eval (RunRecord later) · headless CLI · sink universal-preview.   CUT: shared registry/preset storage abstraction; pick IndexedDB OR OPFS.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top"
